`rules, terms and rates that comply in full` MEANS `Rules, terms and rates` WITH
    `comply with the law and fit Vietnamese practice, ethics, culture and custom` IS TRUE
    `the language of the rules and terms is accurate, simple and easy to understand and technical terms are defined` IS TRUE
    `state clearly insurable interest, object, scope and risks, the rights and duties of the policyholder and insured person, the insurer's liability, exclusions, the method of paying and the dispute provisions` IS TRUE
    `premium is built on statistics, corresponds to the conditions and liability and ensures solvency` IS TRUE
`rules, terms and rates with jargon` MEANS `Rules, terms and rates` WITH
    `comply with the law and fit Vietnamese practice, ethics, culture and custom` IS TRUE
    `the language of the rules and terms is accurate, simple and easy to understand and technical terms are defined` IS FALSE
    `state clearly insurable interest, object, scope and risks, the rights and duties of the policyholder and insured person, the insurer's liability, exclusions, the method of paying and the dispute provisions` IS TRUE
    `premium is built on statistics, corresponds to the conditions and liability and ensures solvency` IS TRUE
`rules, terms and rates with a premium not built on statistics` MEANS `Rules, terms and rates` WITH
    `comply with the law and fit Vietnamese practice, ethics, culture and custom` IS TRUE
    `the language of the rules and terms is accurate, simple and easy to understand and technical terms are defined` IS TRUE
    `state clearly insurable interest, object, scope and risks, the rights and duties of the policyholder and insured person, the insurer's liability, exclusions, the method of paying and the dispute provisions` IS TRUE
    `premium is built on statistics, corresponds to the conditions and liability and ensures solvency` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 87(2): the rules, terms and rates meet the requirements` `rules, terms and rates that comply in full`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 87(2): the rules, terms and rates meet the requirements` `rules, terms and rates with jargon`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 87(2): the rules, terms and rates meet the requirements` `rules, terms and rates with a premium not built on statistics`

