`a life method registered and approved` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `a life insurance product`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS FALSE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS FALSE
`a life method registered but not approved` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `a life insurance product`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS FALSE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS FALSE
`a health method registered and approved` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `a health insurance product`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS FALSE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS FALSE
`a motor method registered and approved, not notified` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `a voluntary motor vehicle insurance product`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS FALSE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS FALSE
`a motor method notified and applied, never registered` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `a voluntary motor vehicle insurance product`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS TRUE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS TRUE
`a motor method notified but not followed` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `a voluntary motor vehicle insurance product`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS TRUE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS FALSE
`a compulsory motor liability method` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `compulsory civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS FALSE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS FALSE
`a method for another non-life product, nothing done` MEANS `A premium method` WITH
    `product line` IS `another non-life insurance product`
    `registered with the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` IS FALSE
    `the insurer applies the method it notified` IS FALSE
-- life and health: the same in all three vintages
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a life method registered and approved`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a life method registered and approved`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a life method registered and approved`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a life method registered but not approved`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a life method registered but not approved`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a health method registered and approved`)
-- voluntary motor: approval in V1, notice from V2
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a motor method registered and approved, not notified`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a motor method registered and approved, not notified`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a motor method registered and approved, not notified`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a motor method notified and applied, never registered`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a motor method notified and applied, never registered`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a motor method notified and applied, never registered`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a motor method notified but not followed`)
-- compulsory motor liability: neither article governs its premium
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a compulsory motor liability method`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a compulsory motor liability method`)
-- another non-life product: no requirement
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a method for another non-life product, nothing done`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a method for another non-life product, nothing done`)
-- before the Law took effect
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2022 6 1) (`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` `a life method registered and approved`)

#ASSERT count `Dieu 87(4): the ways an insurer may offer products` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 87(5): the Government's rules on the dossier, order and procedure to register or notify a premium method`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 87(6): the Minister of Finance's rules on premium methods and on supplying products`

