#ASSERT `Dieu 90(1): the activity may be outsourced` `outsourcing of claims handling`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(1): the activity may be outsourced` `outsourcing of internal audit`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(1): the activity may be outsourced` `outsourcing of internal control`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(1): the activity may be outsourced` `outsourcing of risk management`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(1): the activity may be outsourced` `outsourcing of selling`
#ASSERT `Dieu 90(2)(dd): the provider and any subcontracting meet the Law's requirements` `a provider that performs 75 percent itself`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(2)(dd): the provider and any subcontracting meet the Law's requirements` `a provider that performs 74 percent itself`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(2)(dd): the provider and any subcontracting meet the Law's requirements` `a provider that performs 80 percent and subcontracts without consent`
#ASSERT `Dieu 90(2)(dd): the provider and any subcontracting meet the Law's requirements` `a provider that performs 80 percent and subcontracts with consent`
#ASSERT `Dieu 90(3): the outsourcing contract is in the form and has the contents the Law requires` `a complete outsourcing contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(3): the outsourcing contract is in the form and has the contents the Law requires` `an oral outsourcing contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 90(3): the outsourcing contract is in the form and has the contents the Law requires` `a written outsourcing contract that omits dispute resolution`

